&_nc_oc=AdpTy6Hnm6N2_6mhY0TG4oYY9vjVc1X1c5oxBzDldq2hCQlPqsF9Hd8Q4hgVEEmkA6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5dK7A9-J2lTN1sNfILFIAJ9gBccGF30wiu41u-XitxA&oe=6AE9FABE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yjBXFqCSsGIQ7kNvwHIK6ZD&_nc_oc=AdpUsWvSHqjntYdfOLc5q8oC2Rs4H0mWadfEOSfwmRwZqhBu5_ZANJX3SPkSTxP3JWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRn4ZL1CSjqRttT9PmnOFdXgBEV2L__jq7NDlRmuZ6kVw&oe=6AEA0BBC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0_q6k8N3kK8Q7kNvwF-kyce&_nc_oc=AdqBxZB8ksS9FjAbqzBVl5IAeqZCjhX_vK_ir-iZHAS5aqWaV2SHTtvMvIQSkpAj00w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVZjuADRkBZNtXCWi839V4lu7_BRf_Dv9GxH59qkw1sA&oe=6AE9F207"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bDiN8jSUQIYQ7kNvwFiMpyl&_nc_oc=AdqD75lPcrWD6k9HGNOsGnQSHQhIqIskA5vzkCH_wdYEpS1EyEkNtVX0r56jYOzsTFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTrfiuV9zQpvHwyXVuApZGfbq_rFoeSbtnuqIy2P1PkZw&oe=6AEA1615"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sQojeLeksSUQ7kNvwEtktnS&_nc_oc=AdpthOzy6HzcxvMhnqb3wxNl3wgmgd_SUWa_YObH7Vw_WuBj7GHXwGb-aJjyl9JICME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRfxTHMb0n2N-AXA3R_0jbivyEpyOm8JFs2ZOtqYTX1mA&oe=6AE9EA64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.